    "the repo is fine — diagnosing it as absent is the bug; got \(sync(app).label)")
  XCTAssertTrue(
    button(app, id: "vcs.toolbar.sync").isHittable,
    "the retry has to be clickable, or the tier is just a nicer dead end")
